\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1626/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 133/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2142/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.918      1 Template:PMWC_box\n100.00%    8.918      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9224:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190828 and revision id 114445. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}